Dear Mrs. Kathy Havens,

Greetings from FairBanks Medical Centre Limited.

We are grateful to Within Africa Foundation and the Grants Department for the opportunity to proceed to the Category 2 Review Stage following the successful consideration of our Concept Note.

In response to your invitation, please find attached our Full Project Proposal for the FairBanks Community Health Reach Project – “An Integrated Community-Based Model for Preventive Healthcare, Early Detection, Referral and Continuity of Care in Underserved Communities of Kampala, Uganda.”

The proposal presents the project rationale, goal, activities and deliverables, expected results, implementation plan, project scope and work breakdown structure, timeline, resources, budget, sustainability strategy, project personnel, partnerships, accountability arrangements, and monitoring and evaluation framework, in accordance with the recommended Category 2 requirements.

We have also included the relevant supporting annexes and supporting documentation available at this stage for your review and consideration.

We sincerely appreciate the opportunity to present this project to Within Africa Foundation and look forward to the possibility of partnering to strengthen access to preventive and continuous healthcare among underserved peri-urban communities in Kampala.

Thank you for your consideration.

Yours faithfully,
Racheal Nabukeera 
Founder & Managing Director
FairBanks Medical Centre Limited
Kampala, Uganda
Email: info@fairbanksmedicalcentre.org ()
Website: www.fairbanksmedicalcentre.org ()
